  "title": "Between offer",
  "description": "One message between two household agents. Strict: unknown properties are rejected. 'ask' is always what the thread initiator needs covered; 'give' is what the initiator takes on in return (null means no trade). A thread allows at most 3 counters before only accept or decline is valid."
